SUMMARY:KTSG (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Chelsea
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to vibe with The Electric Ministry\, bringing some serious energy and good times your way! Vienna\, join us. This September\, KTSG is bringing it back to home turf for the release of their debut album at Chelsea Vienna. After months of building\, writing\, recording\, scheming\, sweating\, and turning electricity into songs\, the record is finally ready to leave the shadows and meet the room. This is more than an album release show. This is an invitation. Bring your friends\, bring your people\, bring anyone who needs a night of loud guitars\, shaking floors\, and that strange little magic that only happens when the whole room catches the same feeling. Join us for the first proper gathering of The Electric Ministry. Join us for new songs\, old favourites\, full-force live energy\, and a night made for everyone who wants to feel the vibe\, move with the crowd\, and be part of something as it begins. KTSG has carved out its own world somewhere between rock\, soul\, psych\, grit\, and electric sermon energy. Now the doors are opening. Bring friends. Feel the vibes. Let’s make this a night to remember.    www.instagram.com/ktsg.official/   Tickets: www.eventbrite.at/e/ktsg-the-electric-ministry-tickets-1991577199014?aff=Venue
URL:https://www.chelsea.co.at/concerts.php#concert_6712
END:VEVENT
